comment author Shinryuu
comment v5.5: v5.4 with the Metal Man refight fill 4 frames earlier: the Crash Man refight is 1 frame faster (the second Air Shooter volley comes 1 frame earlier from a different jump, so the second hit lands on slot 4 and the kill on slot 3 one frame sooner) and the hub pause uses the up+down menu trick; the Metal capsule is entered with a re-picked subpixel so Metal Man still makes his low jump, and the Flash capsule walk is re-timed; two Wily Machine Metal Blade throws turned up-right keep every hit on the same frame with the new stale subpixels and the Wily 6 platform seeds in range. v5.4: both Wily Machine fights faster (Wily 6 starts 8 frames earlier). v5.3: alien fight 2 frames faster (pause-menu up+down cursor trick flips the hit parity; Mega Man ends his stun at X 37.06 on the secret ledge). v5.2: one lag frame removed before Wily 4 (Mega Man hops into Metal Man's boss door). v5.1: combined movie. Shinryuu's unpublished, faster run (reconstructed from his video) from the start to Wily 4, combined with our improvements (v3 Guts Tank fight, v4.1 Wily 4, v4.2 Wily 5/6) and two Wily 5 refight levers: the Air Man refight is 11 frames faster (Leaf Shield deployed right after the first hit and thrown while Mega Man rises, between the tornado rows), so the Wood Man fill ends 12 frames earlier; the Metal Man refight is 2 frames faster and the Flash capsule is reached 1 frame sooner, so the Flash Man fill ends 4 frames earlier. Refight RNG re-synced through capsule subpixels; Wily 6 platform seeds set with Metal Blade knobs. 254 frames faster than publication 4410.
